{"title":"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(By_CanadaMath)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(By CanadaMath)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(chinese)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(chinese)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For which of the following values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> does the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/a/4daf322db120240e73326c8de6ef29157cc0c296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x-1}{x-2} = \\frac{x-k}{x-6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"115\" height=\"37\" /> have no solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/5/7752ab84e23c215afdc175282988b652ec621f8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The domain over which we solve the equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/f/91fb7c8725435c19dc3d626ebac9754d252dbd5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{R} \\setminus \\{2,6\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>We can now cross-multiply to get rid of the fractions, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/2/5c2cba921ad00ab769c4e37e5e15b7546caf847e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-1)(x-6)=(x-k)(x-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"247\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Simplifying that, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/f/c8f501a26def565bd88ecc7369b497d0c97e9301.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7x-6 = (k+2)x - 2k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" />. Clearly for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5bb215d21ddfbe2ec17a99cb7118ca80e4a2ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=5$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />&#160;we get the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70f67ffa6e6e3ccc2701ba71c502d657dcbebd26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-6=-10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"79\" height=\"13\" />&#160;which is never true. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98bf7c3854bc12eeabff9ea99c27507eaa11113f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{ (E)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"53\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p><br />\nFor other <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, one can solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/5/015453e6f3bdf5a07ba8333c8f1eeca4090b4fde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(5-k) = 6-2k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"18\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4b03f6ae48cc6b90cce5df0aa4c6b92b4f8c6c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac {6-2k}{5-k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"87\" height=\"37\" />. We can easily verify that for none of the other 4 possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is this equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, hence there is a solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in each of the other cases.\n</p><p>-Edited by XxHalo711 (typo within the solution)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28By_CanadaMath.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(By_CanadaMath)\">Video Solution(By CanadaMath)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(By CanadaMath)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZIwuz_QQ7qg&amp;ab_channel=CanadaMath\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZIwuz_QQ7qg&amp;ab_channel=CanadaMath</a>\n</p><p>~bella\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28chinese.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(chinese)\">Video Solution(chinese)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(chinese)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ePjH8-thEFg&amp;list=PL51hfDy6jt17WNprkym2-d7-xO-gBP9AR&amp;index=12\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ePjH8-thEFg&amp;list=PL51hfDy6jt17WNprkym2-d7-xO-gBP9AR&amp;index=12</a>\n</p><p>~dnathan12\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-s